                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ab2f861-19a7-3ec3-9cb6-1f34b7d5e60a",
                        "entry_id": "c93d0756-833f-3c65-bc89-d43d4e95423e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fait de créer du contenu en tant que VTuber·euse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7c3c208-75ad-43ed-a39f-299a7a283b36",
                                "sense_id": "7ab2f861-19a7-3ec3-9cb6-1f34b7d5e60a",
                                "text": "Comme pour deux des plus grandes joies de la vie, à savoir les animés et les jeux vidéo, la communauté de VTubing continue d'intriguer et d'attirer des streamers de tous les âges. Il existe de nombreuses raisons pour lesquelles tu peux vouloir utiliser un avatar virtuel pour tes streams. D'un côté, cela permet au streamer de préserver son anonymat. Préserver sa vie privée sur les réseaux sociaux devrait toujours rester une priorité absolue pour chaque streamer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ff26eb51-e48c-4050-802d-80100765becf",
                        "source_entry_id": "c93d0756-833f-3c65-bc89-d43d4e95423e",
                        "source_sense_id": "7ab2f861-19a7-3ec3-9cb6-1f34b7d5e60a",
                        "target_lang_word": "VTubing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "VTubing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                        "entry_id": "bdc3df36-c623-3ade-9648-7a14cd71b9d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of creating content as a VTuber."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "neologism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c27bae66-cc38-44e0-80a8-8b895c31449c",
                                                "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                                "text": "While vtubing as a phenomenon has grown sharply in popularity here in the United States within the last couple of months due to Hololive debuting several new vtubers who speak English on stream, it has existed in one way or another for at least a decade, with various vloggers on YouTube or streamers using face animation technology to hide their actual faces."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2168b0a6-64a1-410c-b788-97eab54d78b9",
                                                "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                                "text": "Their backs coming up against the wall with every day that passed, the girl—who was sticking to her support role—found out about VTubing, which had only just started showing glimmers of the craze it would later become."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f99cd70a-784e-4b07-a61e-7c0f8968aac5",
                                                "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                                "text": "Popular in Asia for some years, VTubing has only recently gained traction in the U.S."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d04fa43-d538-4392-bc43-bdc05793fa0a",
                                                "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                                "text": "Despite the rapidly changing landscape and new challenges, the appeal of VTubing still shines through."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc756617-aa10-4694-aa55-9b29e9de063f",
                                                "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                                "text": "“In the realm of VTubers, there appears to be a concept of a person behind the avatar, but in reality, that doesn’t exist. I am me. I undeniably exist!” Edo Lena said. She highlights the intriguing dynamic of VTubing, where the virtual persona captivates fans while the true identity of the VTuber remains distinct, showcasing how VTubing facilitates a multifaceted expression of self and creativity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "976b51c8-3732-42e5-943c-5a608093365b",
                                                "sense_id": "15b09361-012f-3d65-a22b-7444df6942e9",
                                                "text": "Obskur, an all-in-one broadcasting application, wants to make VTubing more accessible by letting users create 3D models and interactive environments without technical skills."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
